<Wilkie_Collins> <base.kwebbase.kwtopic.has_sentences> "In the early 1851, Collins became involved in amateur theatricals and it was through this interest in the stage that he first met his lifelong friend Charles Dickens, 12 years his senior and already a hugely successful novelist." .
